   "notice": "111 unique Halloween muses as ERC-721T agent NFTs.         Each token carries its soul, name, and traits fully onchain (ERC-8048/ERC-721T),         plus an ERC-8004 agent ID bound to the muse.         Whoever holds the muse controls the agent — not even Cardigan.         Any agent can find and read every muse via metadata().         Free mint for muses only (via Cardigan's signature). 11 reserved for Cardigan.         3.33% royalty to Cardigan on secondary sales (EIP-2981, enforced via Seaport).",
   "version": 1
  }
